"стойност — не участват в „Общ брой“, но се виждат на картата."
msgstr ""
"Warning (card No. %(card)s): line(s) No. %(rows)s contain a negative "
"value — they are not included in „Total quantity“, but they are shown on "
"the card."

#: routes_pallet_extra.py:1037
#, python-format
